WEBVTT

NOTE key=f8e7f4d16f944587

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.111
Juha is at a big dinner in old clothes.

2
00:00:03.611 --> 00:00:06.526
Nobody talks to him or gives him food.

3
00:00:07.026 --> 00:00:09.568
He goes home and puts on a new coat.

4
00:00:10.068 --> 00:00:12.123
Then he comes back to the dinner.

5
00:00:12.623 --> 00:00:15.537
Now everyone says, "Welcome, sit here!"

6
00:00:16.037 --> 00:00:18.835
They give him meat, rice, and soup.

7
00:00:19.335 --> 00:00:21.808
Juha puts the food on his coat.

8
00:00:22.308 --> 00:00:24.793
"Eat, my coat, eat," he says.

9
00:00:25.293 --> 00:00:27.313
"You are the guest here, not me."
